          "name": "Amazon Kinesis Write multiple data records to a stream in a single call",
          "request": {
            "name": "Amazon Kinesis Write multiple data records to a stream in a single call",
            "description": {
              "content": "Writes multiple data records into a Kinesis data stream in a single call (also referred to as a PutRecords request). Use this operation to send data into the stream for data ingestion and processing. Each PutRecords request can support up to 500 records. Each record in the request can be as large as 1 MiB, up to a limit of 5 MiB for the entire request, including partition keys.",
